            "details": "Emits {Deployment} on completion. After this call, this assembler holds no privileged         roles on any of the returned contracts. The Controller is granted CONTROLLER on the         ALMProxy and on the RateLimits.         Notes:         - When `integrationIds` is empty, the Controller `updateIntegrations` call is           skipped entirely (the Controller reverts on an empty array), so a stack can be           deployed with no integrations and configured later by an admin.",
